      "description": "The original geometric card frame, selected lift, and written inscription state.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-preview\"><button class=\"ds-formula-card ds-linear ds-selected\" aria-pressed=\"true\" aria-label=\"Select Twin Ember, 2x\"><span class=\"ds-card-top\"><span>LINEAR</span><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3C10 7 5 12 5 16a7 7 0 0 0 14 0c0-4-5-9-7-13Z\"/><path d=\"M9 16c0 2 1 3 3 3\"/></svg></span><div class=\"ds-card-art\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 100\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"54\" r=\"40\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".6\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"54\" r=\"32\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\".5\"/><path d=\"m58 75 27-48 27 48Zm32 0 27-48 27 48Z\" fill=\"currentColor\" fill-opacity=\".15\" stroke=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M28 54h26m92 0h26\" stroke=\"currentColor\"/></svg></div><span class=\"ds-card-expression\">2x</span><span class=\"ds-card-name\">Twin Ember</span><span class=\"ds-card-description\">A spark, perfectly mirrored.</span><span class=\"ds-card-bottom\">FORMULA<span>Cost depends on x</span></span><span class=\"ds-selected-tab\">INSCRIBED</span></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-preview{font-family:Scholar,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:#253c38}button{font:inherit;color:inherit;cursor:pointer;border:0;transition:background .18s,color .18s,transform .18s,box-shadow .18s}button:disabled{cursor:default}button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #b87936;outline-offset:5px}button:not(:disabled):active{transform:translateY(1px)}button:disabled:not(.ds-enemy):not(.ds-formula-card){opacity:.48}button:disabled:not(.enemy):not(.ds-formula-card){opacity:.48}.ds-formula-card{width:171px;height:222px;flex-shrink:0;border:1px solid #ad9e76;background:#f5efdd;box-shadow:0 7px 13px #4b4d3620;border-radius:9px;position:relative;padding:10px 10px 8px;display:flex;align-items:center;flex-direction:column;outline:4px solid #e2dcc5;outline-offset:-7px;color:#7d6543;transition:transform .2s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1),box-shadow .2s;transform:rotate(-2deg)}.ds-formula-card:nth-child(2n){transform:rotate(1deg)}.ds-formula-card:nth-child(3n){transform:rotate(2deg)}.ds-formula-card:before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:7px;border:1px solid #c5b88d;border-radius:4px;pointer-events:none}.ds-formula-card.ds-quadratic{color:#64766f}.ds-formula-card.ds-additive{color:#8b6459}.ds-formula-card:not(:disabled):hover{transform:translateY(-9px) rotate(0deg);box-shadow:0 14px 18px #3c51352b}.ds-formula-card.ds-selected{transform:translateY(-12px) rotate(0deg);box-shadow:0 10px 20px #2e54452b;border:2px solid var(--teal,#2c6961);padding:9px 9px 7px}.ds-card-top{width:100%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:3px 4px 0;font-size:7px;letter-spacing:.13em;font-weight:600;z-index:1}.ds-card-art{height:73px;width:100%;margin-top:5px;background:#e7ddbf;overflow:hidden}.ds-quadratic .ds-card-art{background:#dce4d4}.ds-additive .ds-card-art{background:#e8d6c5}.ds-card-art svg{height:100%;width:100%}.ds-card-expression{font:600 32px/.9 var(--serif,Constant,Georgia,serif);margin-top:7px;color:#2f493b}.ds-card-name{font:600 19px var(--serif,Constant,Georgia,serif);margin-top:5px;color:#2f493b}.ds-card-description{font:italic 10px/1.3 var(--serif,Constant,Georgia,serif);max-width:135px;display:block;margin-top:3px;min-height:25px;text-align:center;color:#5c6854}.ds-card-bottom{display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:6px;letter-spacing:.07em;border-top:1px solid #d4caae;padding:6px 4px 0;margin-top:auto}.ds-card-bottom>span{font-size:6px;letter-spacing:0}.ds-selected-tab{position:absolute;left:25px;right:25px;top:-11px;background:var(--teal,#2c6961);color:#f3efdc;font-size:7px;letter-spacing:.13em;padding:4px 7px;border-radius:2px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*,*:before,*:after{animation:none!important;transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}"
